      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58d2df84430f4652e88c5666|full_name}: Even if a list is not made, which is still something I strongly support, at the very very least there needs to be a rank or indication of who is a moderator. Such a thing exists for developers (red name tag + side tag with descriptor). As stated already too, if they need to be undercover, they can make themselves invisible.",
      "viewerReactions": null
